# signal; splitting between PoW and Avalanche stake breaks the math).
#
# This patch removes Avalanche from the CONSENSUS path only:
#   - Remove chain-tip finalization hooks in src/net_processing.cpp
#   - Remove block validity checks that require Avalanche quorum
#   - Remove mandatory Avalanche startup checks in src/init.cpp
#
# DO NOT remove src/avalanche/ or the Avalanche CMake option.
# Avalanche stays in the codebase for soft parameter voting:
#   - Preferred minimum fee rates
#   - Mempool policy preferences
#   - Network parameter governance
# Avalanche votes have no authority over which block is valid.
